<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Booking Confirmed</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      background-color: #f4f7f6;
      color: #333333;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }
    .wrapper {
      width: 100%;
      background-color: #f4f7f6;
      padding: 40px 0;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 8px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
    }
    .header {
      background-color: #10b981;
      padding: 30px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .header h1 {
      color: #ffffff;
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .content {
      padding: 40px 30px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .content h2 {
      font-size: 20px;
      margin-top: 0;
      color: #1f2937;
    }
    .receipt {
      background-color: #f9fafb;
      border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 20px;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
    .receipt-item {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .receipt-item:last-child {
      margin-bottom: 0;
      border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
      padding-top: 10px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
    .footer {
      background-color: #f9fafb;
      padding: 20px 30px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #9ca3af;
      border-top: 1px solid #f3f4f6;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        <h1>TurfSync</h1>
      </div>
      <div class="content">
        <h2>Your Booking is Confirmed!</h2>
        <p>Thank you for using TurfSync to book your match slots. Your booking request has been successfully confirmed. Below are the details of your reservation:</p>
        
        <div class="receipt">
          <div class="receipt-item">
            <span><strong>Booking ID:</strong></span>
            <span>#{{booking.id}}</span>
          </div>
          {{#if booking.turfName}}
          <div class="receipt-item">
            <span><strong>Turf Name:</strong></span>
            <span>{{booking.turfName}}</span>
          </div>
          {{/if}}
          {{#if booking.date}}
          <div class="receipt-item">
            <span><strong>Date:</strong></span>
            <span>{{booking.date}}</span>
          </div>
          {{/if}}
          {{#if booking.startTime}}
          <div class="receipt-item">
            <span><strong>Time:</strong></span>
            <span>{{booking.startTime}} {{#if booking.endTime}} - {{booking.endTime}}{{/if}}</span>
          </div>
          {{/if}}
          {{#if booking.totalAmount}}
          <div class="receipt-item">
            <span><strong>Total Amount:</strong></span>
            <span>${{booking.totalAmount}}</span>
          </div>
          {{/if}}
        </div>

        <p>Please make sure to arrive at the turf 10-15 minutes before your slot begins. Enjoy your match!</p>
        <p>Best regards,<br>The TurfSync Team</p>
      </div>
      <div class="footer">
        <p>&copy; 2026 TurfSync. All rights reserved.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
